  swarm-rust paea reconcile-effects LEDGER --root ROOT --json
    Read-only reconciliation of the real effect journals (PA-09); no effect, no authority.
  swarm-rust paea transfer-call SERVICE PROJECT WORK CHILD PIN STAGING DECLARATION --input REQUEST.json
    Guarded two-phase Git transfer: public preparation, out-of-band provisioning, private stdin frame; native Reconcile operation, no ref effect.
  swarm-rust paea promote-call commit|reconcile SERVICE PROJECT WORK CHILD PIN DECLARATION --input REQUEST.json
    Guarded two-phase Git promotion: durable intent + OLD-fenced reference transaction (commit) or pure journal read (reconcile); private stdin frame.
  swarm-rust paea settlement-call commit|reconcile PROJECT LEDGER DECLARATION --input REQUEST.json
    Guarded two-phase fictitious settlement: durable separate-ledger effect (commit) or pure journal read (reconcile); private stdin frame.
  swarm-rust run-limits show|history|preview|apply SCOPE MISSION KEY --root ROOT [--input FILE] --json
  swarm-rust run-limits effective MISSION ROLE TASK --root ROOT --json
  swarm-rust run-limits rollback-preview|rollback SCOPE MISSION KEY REV --root ROOT --input FILE --json
  swarm-rust run-limits provider-wait show|history|preview|apply --root ROOT [--input FILE] --json
  swarm-rust trust show|config-preview|config-apply|mandate-create|request|approve|commit|reconcile|export|anchor|verify|blp-show|blp-policy-preview|blp-policy-apply|blp-check|blp-object-attribute|blp-preparation-check --root ROOT [--input FILE|-]
    blp-*: Bell-LaPadula confidentiality policy administration and diagnostic on supplied labels; no runtime control (runtime_enforced:false). blp-show/blp-policy-preview/blp-check/blp-object-attribute require a current I3/admin. blp-object-attribute classifies an exact canonical digest/path at current revisions; no declassification or physical lineage proof.
