  swarm-rust identity service-call SHA256 PRIVATE_SEED --input BOOTSTRAP [--json]
    Local operator call: binary stdin packet, no listener or session.
  swarm-rust identity service-install|service-resume|service-reconcile SHA256 --input ABSOLUTE_PRIVATE_ARTIFACT [--json]
    Initial installation only; no human account or service started.
  swarm-rust identity personal-init|personal-enroll|personal-recover SHA256_DIGEST PRIVATE_KEY --input BOOTSTRAP [--json]
    personal-enroll: binary frame on stdin; no secrets in argv.
  swarm-rust identity initial-create|initial-reconcile REQUEST_PIN OPERATOR_DIRECTORY PRIVATE_ANCHOR --input PRIVATE_REQUEST [--json]
    Dormant material only; intent before generation, no account/Root/service/human admitted.
  swarm-rust identity checkpoint-check REQUEST_PIN --input ABSOLUTE_PRIVATE_ANCHOR [--json]
    Read only; caller must establish locator trust, no package read/creation.
  swarm-rust identity operator-check PIN --input PRIVATE_OPERATOR_DIRECTORY [--json]
  swarm-rust identity service-export|service-export-reconcile PIN PRIVATE_OUTPUT --input PRIVATE_OPERATOR_DIRECTORY [--json]
    Service artifact only; no installation, new keys/proof or verified human identity.
  swarm-rust identity provisioning-check SHA256_DIGEST --input ABSOLUTE_PRIVATE_REQUEST [--json]
    Preflight only; no material generated, account verified or service started.
  swarm-rust identity bootstrap-check SHA256_DIGEST --input FILE [--json]
  swarm-rust identity control-check SHA256_DIGEST --input FILE [--json] (preflight, no service start)
Language: --lang fr|en. init starts no service; web starts the native development API.
Partial migration: only the listed Rust commands are currently available.
  swarm-rust protection canonicalize --input FILE|- --json (offline data only; no authority)
  swarm-rust protection inspect --input FILE|- --json (exact action content; no approval or effect)
  swarm-rust protection check-approval ACTION APPROVAL --json (supplied binding correspondence; no approval or effect)
  swarm-rust protection compare BEFORE AFTER --json (two files; no authority)
  swarm-rust protection resolve-payment REGISTRY REQUEST --json (offline debt resolution; no authority)
  swarm-rust protection check-receipt ACTION RECEIPT SINK PREVIOUS_STATE --json (two files; no authenticity or effect established)
  swarm-rust protection receipt-report ACTION RECEIPT SINK PREVIOUS_STATE --json (schema v2; exact input hashes; no authenticity or effect established)
